        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d762bb9c6/thompson/claims/t1917-014_the-forms-of-cells.py#L502-L522> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
